Alaa,

There is some material at:

http://faculty.missouri.edu/~merklee/blavaan/

https://www.rensvandeschoot.com/tutorials/blavaan-how-to-get-started/

Also, because the blavaan model syntax is so similar to lavaan, the lavaan tutorial and other lavaan examples can be helpful. For example:

https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/index.html

Many of the commands are the same as lavaan, with a "b" at the beginning. For example cfa -> bcfa; sem -> bsem, lavInspect -> blavInspect, etc.

Best,
Ed

